[  215.6s] - **calendar**: supported. "Monday to Friday, except Ferncliff closure days 2026-11-13, 2026-12-24, …" was amended by memo item 2: "2026-11-13 is no longer a closure day … 2026-11-30 (Monday) is added". The holidays list is exactly 11-30, 12-24, 12-25, 12-28, 12-31 and 2027-01-01.
